  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "87d87748-b1aa-4f2a-8643-03e769134717",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# 01 Aritmetick\u00E9 v\u00FDrazy\n\n**autor: Erik Kr\u00E1l ekral@utb.cz**\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "id": "239416af-6452-4cba-88c9-b3977d176a29",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pro zvl\u00E1dnut\u00ED p\u0159edm\u011Btu pot\u0159ebujete v\u011Bd\u011Bt co je to prom\u011Bnn\u00E1 a zn\u00E1t minim\u00E1ln\u011B dva aritmetick\u00E9 datov\u00E9 typy a um\u011Bt definovat prom\u011Bnn\u00E9 t\u011Bchto typ\u016F. Nezapome\u0148te, \u017Ee z\u00E1le\u017E\u00ED i na velk\u00FDch a mal\u00FDch p\u00EDsmenech a prom\u011Bnn\u00E1 \u0060Math.Pow\u0060 mus\u00ED b\u00FDt napsan\u00E1 spr\u00E1vn\u011B v\u010Detn\u011B velk\u00FDch a mal\u00FDch p\u00EDsmen.\n\n**Co je to prom\u011Bnn\u00E1**\n\nN\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED definice vych\u00E1z\u00ED z knihy [A Tour of C\u002B\u002B](https://www.stroustrup.com/tour3.html).\n\n- **Typ** definuje mno\u017Einu mo\u017En\u00FDch hodnot a mno\u017Einu operac\u00ED (pro objekt).\n- **Hodnota** je mno\u017Eina bit\u016F interpretovan\u00E1 podle dan\u00E9ho typu.\n- **Objekt** je pam\u011B\u0165, kter\u00E1 na dan\u00E9 **adrese** uchov\u00E1v\u00E1 hodnotu dan\u00E9ho typu.\n- **Prom\u011Bnn\u00E1** je pojmenovan\u00FD objekt.\n\n**Z\u00E1kladn\u00ED aritmetick\u00E9 datov\u00E9 typy**\n\n- \u0060double y = 0;\u0060 p\u0159edstavuje \u010D\u00EDslo s plovouc\u00ED \u010D\u00E1rkou se znam\u00E9nkem. \n- \u0060int x = 0;\u0060 p\u0159edstavuje cel\u00E9 \u010D\u00EDslo se znam\u00E9nkem.\n\nD\u00E1le byste m\u011Bli zn\u00E1t n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED operace, kter\u00E9 si postupn\u011B probereme na p\u0159\u00EDkladech. "
    },
    {
      "id": "d39de88f-d101-494c-953c-2795499cca51",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Nejprve si definujme t\u0159i prom\u011Bnn\u00E9 \u0060x\u0060, \u0060y\u0060 a \u0060z\u0060:"
    },
    {
      "id": "b68a26c9-df15-4155-ba4e-ff43e8bb1773",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "double x = 9.0;\ndouble y = 3.0;\ndouble z = 0.0;\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E9\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e21210b2-b611-4b56-844e-b23b11567889",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Dejte si pozor na chybu p\u0159i zaokrouhlov\u00E1n\u00ED a reprezentaci \u010D\u00EDsla s plovouc\u00ED \u010D\u00E1rkou. Typ \u0060\u0060\u0060double\u0060\u0060\u0060 pou\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1 bin\u00E1rn\u00ED plovouc\u00ED \u010D\u00E1rku, kde desetinn\u00E9 \u010D\u00EDslo 0.1 je periodick\u00E9 \u010D\u00EDslo. Ov\u011B\u0159te v\u00FDsledek n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED operace."
    },
    {
      "id": "5a630800-d227-4900-a3f0-a0c69617678b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "0.1 \u002B 0.1 \u002B 0.1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E0.30000000000000004\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5935a5ce-db9c-48f7-974c-f1cfda33568f",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "V n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm k\u00F3du jsou uvedeny atematick\u00E9 oper\u00E1tory sou\u010Det, rozd\u00EDl, sou\u010Din, pod\u00EDl, z\u00E1porn\u00E1 hodnota, druh\u00E1 mocnina. Pro druhou mocninu pou\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1me z\u00E1pis \u0060x * x\u0060 proto\u017Ee proto\u017Ee je to rychlej\u0161\u00ED a jednodu\u0161\u00ED ne\u017E pou\u017Eit\u00ED metody *Math.Pow*."
    },
    {
      "id": "4d2a84c0-2076-4279-8f27-880ae54d3dda",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "z = x \u002B y;  // soucet\nz = x - y;  // rozdil\nz = x * y;  // soucin\nz = x / y;  // podil\nz = -x;     // zaporna hodnota\nz = x * x;  // druha mocnina\n\nz",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E81\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a80096c6-b88c-4cf0-a798-add0677fa024",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Dal\u0161\u00ED matematick\u00E9 operace najdeme jako statick\u00E9 prvky t\u0159\u00EDdy *Math*. V n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm k\u00F3du jsou uvedeny p\u0159\u00EDklady mocniny a odmocniny."
    },
    {
      "id": "de12c21d-1f52-4f95-b847-830bc7b0df75",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "z = Math.Pow(2, 100.0); // mocnina x^100\nz = Math.Sqrt(9.0); // druha odmocnina",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8077bc10-1922-4f63-a8d0-63a9eb37cf45",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Math.Sqrt(81.0)",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E9\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fc748889-4e1d-46e0-883b-65c51a2f3aa9",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pou\u017Eit\u00ED konstanty PI ze t\u0159\u00EDdy *Math*."
    },
    {
      "id": "95e06cf5-bf79-453c-8fd1-33f216275acf",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "z = 2 * Math.PI * x; // konstanta PI",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "144e815c-30cb-4590-af47-b6d21c54e77c",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Ur\u010Dov\u00E1n\u00ED priorit oper\u00E1tor\u016F pomoc\u00ED kulat\u00FDch z\u00E1vorek ()."
    },
    {
      "id": "0de4bc4d-6f97-4edc-ab78-7abd3dd03faa",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "x = 2.0;\ny = 3.0;\n",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8090649-d4d1-4475-b9aa-0666b0b28889",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "x * (y / 3.0) // kulate zavorky urcuji prioritu ",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E2\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "53072587-5c61-4c88-95a7-3443b235cf4d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "A nakonec jsou n\u00ED\u017Ee uvedeny p\u0159\u00EDklady zm\u011Bny hodnot prom\u011Bnn\u00E9 samotn\u00E9."
    },
    {
      "id": "d1b907f3-26d1-42e6-b80d-bfcbb6bd130a",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "z = z \u002B 2.0; // zvyseni o hodnotu\nz \u002B= 2.0;\nz = z - 2.0; // snizeni o hodnotu\nz -= 2.0;\n\u002B\u002Bz; // zvyseni o 1\n--z; // snizeni o 1",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7708b3ff-cf80-442e-8f4c-a1d83302dcdd",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pro typ \u0060int\u0060 je z\u00E1pis p\u0159edchoz\u00EDch operac\u00ED stejn\u00FD, jen pou\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1me celo\u010D\u00EDseln\u00E9 numerick\u00E9 konstanty. Nejv\u011Bt\u0161\u00ED rozd\u00EDl je ale v tom, \u017Ee metody *Math.Pow* a *Math.Sqrt* pracuj\u00ED s typem \u0060double\u0060 tak\u017Ee v\u00FDsledek mus\u00EDme explicitn\u011B p\u0159etypovat s pomoc\u00ED z\u00E1pisu \u0060(int)\u0060. Samotn\u00E9 argumenty t\u011Bchto metod jsou ale typu \u0060double\u0060 a typ \u0060int\u0060 lze na typ \u0060double\u0060 p\u0159ev\u00E9st implicitn\u011B (nemus\u00EDme do k\u00F3du nic ps\u00E1t)."
    },
    {
      "id": "a39f1d99-4955-400c-bcf6-c85f1d6d0f6c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int a = 2;\nint b = 3;\nb = (int)Math.Pow(a, 100.0); // mocnina x^100\nb = (int)Math.Sqrt(9.0); // druha odmocnina\na = a \u002B 2; // zvyseni o hodnotu\na = a - 2; // snizeni o hodnotu",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3efcf355-7030-4a23-8708-c9a9afe22f1e",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "V n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm k\u00F3du jsou shrnut\u00E9 v\u0161echny p\u0159edchoz\u00ED oper\u00E1tory a funkce."
    },
    {
      "id": "e763e426-281b-4a8c-8209-81aa581c1c56",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "double x = 2.0;\ndouble y = 3.0;\ndouble z = 0.0;\n\n// Matematicke operatory\nz = x \u002B y; // soucet\nz = x - y; // rozdil\nz = x * y; // soucin\nz = x / y; // podil\nz = -x; // numeric negation\nz = x * x; // druha mocnina\n\n// Matematicke operace ze tridy Math\nz = Math.Pow(x, 100.0); // mocnina x^100\nz = Math.Sqrt(9.0); // druha odmocnina\n\n// Konstanta PI\nz = 2 * Math.PI * x; // konstanta PI\n// Priorita operatoru\nz = x * (y \u002B 3.0); // kulate zavorky urcuji prioritu \n\n// Zmena hodnoty promenne\nz = z \u002B 2.0; // zvyseni o hodnotu\nz = z - 2.0; // snizeni o hodnotu\n\u002B\u002Bz; // zvyseni o 1\n--z; // snizeni o 1\n\n// Operace pro int\nint a = 2;\nint b = 3;\nb = (int)Math.Pow(a, 100.0); // mocnina x^100\nb = (int)Math.Sqrt(9.0); // druha odmocnina\na = a \u002B 2; // zvyseni o hodnotu\na = a - 2; // snizeni o hodnotu",
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a37fba59-1d64-4097-9d13-00eb4420d239",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## V\u00FDstup na konzoli"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8ff648b-582f-4073-a1f4-0957dcc29890",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Na konzoli m\u016F\u017Eeme vypsat text pomoc\u00ED statick\u00E9 metody \u0060Console.WriteLine\u0060. \u010Casto pou\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1me string interpolation, kdy p\u0159ed \u0159et\u011Bzcem uvedeme znak \u0060$\u0060 a do slo\u017Een\u00FDch z\u00E1vorek potom zap\u00ED\u0161eme v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD se p\u0159evede na \u0159et\u011Bzec."
    },
    {
      "id": "b62d7176-3554-44b6-9343-a92e5a462f24",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Console.WriteLine(\u0022Ahoj\u0022);\n\nint x = 3;\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022hodnota x je {x}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Ahoj\nhodnota x je 3\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bd9adb64-4ab3-4be2-9391-8315d50106d6",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8cb0fa9b-4702-4596-b271-1835f7026ec0",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "---\n## P\u0159\u00EDklady k procvi\u010Dov\u00E1n\u00ED"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b425b63-10f7-491d-9c38-a6d2a7228eb2",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 1. Obsah a obvod \u010Dtverce"
    },
    {
      "id": "85491168-bf5e-4922-bd12-88ea3fc56949",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Ctverec je definovany delkou strany n\n// Spocitejte a vypiste jeho obvod a obsah\n\ndouble n = 3.0;\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Delka strany je {n}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Delka strany je 3\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c6adb5b8-3bb9-4a1e-9c78-d1b918b47539",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 2. Obsah a obvod kruhu"
    },
    {
      "id": "a33e9ca5-bbce-46dd-bb07-1248a6d6f1e2",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Kruh je definovany polomerem r\n// spocitejte a vypiste obvod a obsah kruhu\n\ndouble r = 3.0;\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Polomer kruhu je {r}\u0022);\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Hodnota Pi je {Math.PI}\u0022);\n\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Polomer kruhu je 3\nHodnota Pi je 3.141592653589793\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "21a51580-9ac1-4fbc-8fbc-7b6be67bf296",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 3. Obsah a obvod troj\u00FAheln\u00EDka"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2260c05-b7f2-4008-bba0-8c9676f1f02f",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Trojuhelnik je definovany delkami stran a,b,c.\n// spocitejte a vypiste obvod a obsah trojuhelniku dle heronova vzorce https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heron%C5%AFv_vzorec\n\ndouble a = 3.0;\ndouble b = 4.0;\ndouble c = 5.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Delka strany trojuhelnika je {a}, {b} a {c}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Delka strany trojuhelnika je 3, 4 a 5\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e71114cd-20a2-4549-bad3-700a1719c871",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 4. V\u00FDpo\u010Det BMI"
    },
    {
      "id": "bff3d592-f4f9-44d7-a1d8-bfc613030bb5",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Vypoctete a vypiste BMI dle vzorce https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Index_t%C4%9Blesn%C3%A9_hmotnosti\n\ndouble hmotnost = 85;\ndouble vyska = 1.78;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022hmotnost {hmotnost}kg a vyska {vyska}m\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "hmotnost 85kg a vyska 1.78m\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "357cc125-c092-43f9-8be4-8b18a6ed7838",
      "type": "markdown",
