      "id": "b4238662-06d2-41aa-9243-341a401df7a4",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED: 1. Obsah a obvod \u010Dtverce"
    },
    {
      "id": "da2ba665-269e-4001-a8c8-59566a24c442",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Ctverec je definovany delkou strany n\n// Spocitejte a vypiste jeho obvod a obsah\n\ndouble n = 3.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Delka strany je {n}\u0022);\n\ndouble obvod = 4 * n;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obvod je {obvod}\u0022);\n\ndouble obsah = n * n;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obsah je {obsah}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Delka strany je 3\nObvod je 12\nObsah je 9\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "683268ab-0a5a-47b1-9315-6f95c33bb15b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED: 2. Obsah a obvod kruhu"
    },
    {
      "id": "917694c9-a1a6-413b-8df3-50a58efbeb27",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Kruh je definovany polomerem r\n// spocitejte a vypiste obvod a obsah kruhu\n\ndouble r = 3.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Polomer kruhu je {r}\u0022);\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Hodnota Pi je {Math.PI}\u0022);\n\ndouble obvod = 2 * Math.PI * r;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obvod je {obvod}\u0022);\n\ndouble obsah = Math.PI * r * r;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obsah je {obsah}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Polomer kruhu je 3\nHodnota Pi je 3.141592653589793\nObvod je 18.84955592153876\nObsah je 28.274333882308138\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f6f9dbc1-5258-4c97-b87d-79c0b997ef50",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED: 3. Obsah a obvod troj\u00FAheln\u00EDka"
    },
    {
      "id": "a40fc3e6-54fe-40a9-ad56-d3db38d827ab",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Trojuhelnik je definovany delkami stran a,b,c.\n// spocitejte a vypiste obvod a obsah trojuhelniku dle heronova vzorce https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heron%C5%AFv_vzorec\n\ndouble a = 3.0;\ndouble b = 4.0;\ndouble c = 5.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Delka strany trojuhelnika je {a}, {b} a {c}\u0022);\n\ndouble obvod = a \u002B b \u002B c;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obvod je {obvod}\u0022);\n\ndouble s = (a \u002B b \u002B c) / 2;\ndouble obsah = Math.Sqrt(s * (s - a) * (s - b) * (s -c));\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Obsah je {obsah}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Delka strany trojuhelnika je 3, 4 a 5\nObvod je 12\nObsah je 6\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 21
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "07711cbf-1196-423c-9c1b-72ab969a4cdc",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED: 4. V\u00FDpo\u010Det BMI"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7518dba-c8bd-45ee-a87f-e0bf4033d705",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Vypoctete a vypiste BMI dle vzorce https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Index_t%C4%9Blesn%C3%A9_hmotnosti\n\ndouble hmotnost = 85;\ndouble vyska = 1.78;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022hmotnost {hmotnost}kg a vyska {vyska}m\u0022);\n\n\n\ndouble bmi = hmotnost / (vyska * vyska);\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022bmi je {bmi}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "hmotnost 85kg a vyska 1.78m\nbmi je 26.82742078020452\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "875836c3-2052-4f3b-8bdc-0970defe38ad",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED: 5. V\u00FDpo\u010Det spl\u00E1tky \u00FAroku"
    },
    {
      "id": "df05be3e-e866-491c-9459-cb878358c140",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// Vypoctete a vypiste splatky uroku dle vzorce http://www.aristoteles.cz/matematika/financni_matematika/hypoteka-vypocet.php\n\nint pocetLetSplaceni = 20;\ndouble rocniUrokProcenta = 2;\ndouble D = 1000000; // dluh\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Pocet let {pocetLetSplaceni}, urok {rocniUrokProcenta}% rocne a castka {D} Kc\u0022);\n\nint n = pocetLetSplaceni * 12; // pocet mesicu splaceni\ndouble i = rocniUrokProcenta / (12 * 100); // desetinne cislo\n\ndouble v = 1 / (1 \u002B i);\ndouble splatka = (i * D) / (1 - Math.Pow(v, n));\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022Mesicni splatka bude {splatka:F2} Kc\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Pocet let 20, urok 2% rocne a castka 1000000 Kc\nMesicni splatka bude 5058.83 Kc\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 23
      }
    }
  ]
